title: CCF(SS) President Election
new-page: true
subtitle: Who will lead our party?
tags: event
view-if: year = 1932 and month = 2
priority: 1000
max-visits: 1
face-image: img/CCF_Convention.jpg
on-display: {!
    var left_sidebar = document.getElementById('stats_sidebar'); 
    var right_sidebar = document.getElementById('stats_sidebar_right'); 

    window.ChangeTab('left', 'Leader_Election.GHW', 'none');
    window.ChangeTab('right', 'Leader_Election.MJC', 'none');

    var allTabContainers = left_sidebar.getElementsByClassName('tab_container');
    var allTabContainers_right = right_sidebar.getElementsByClassName('tab_container');
    
    for (let i = 0; i < allTabContainers.length; i++) {
            allTabContainers[i].style.display = 'none';
    }
    for (let i = 0; i < allTabContainers_right.length; i++) {
            allTabContainers_right[i].style.display = 'none';
    }
!} 
on-departure: {!
    var left_sidebar = document.getElementById('stats_sidebar'); 
    var right_sidebar = document.getElementById('stats_sidebar_right');

    var allTabContainers = left_sidebar.getElementsByClassName('tab_container');
    var allTabContainers_right = right_sidebar.getElementsByClassName('tab_container');
    
    for (let i = 0; i < allTabContainers.length; i++) {
            allTabContainers[i].style.display = '';
    }
    for (let i = 0; i < allTabContainers_right.length; i++) {
            allTabContainers_right[i].style.display = '';
    }

    window.ChangeTab('left', 'status', 'party_tab');
    window.ChangeTab('right', 'status_right', 'main_tab');

!}

= Selection of our President

The time has come for the CCF(SS) to select a President. Five distinguished party members have been nominated though 3 have already declined to run. That leaves 2, George Williams and Major James Coldwell. 

We must pick wisely...


- @GeorgeWilliams: George Williams will surely lead the CCF(SS) to victory.
- @Coldwell: Coldwell will surely lead the CCF(SS) to victory. 

@GeorgeWilliams 
on-arrival: farmers_ccf_ss += 4; agrarian_strength += 4; agrarian_dissent -= 4; ccf_ss_president = "George Hara Williams"; ccf_ss_president_img = "WilliamsHaraGeorge.jpg"
face-image: img/portraits/WilliamsHaraGeorge.jpg

Williams will lead us to victory!

@Coldwell
on-arrival: workers_ccf_ss += 4; labour_strength += 4; labour_dissent -= 4; ccf_ss_president = "Major James Coldwell"; ccf_ss_president_img = "ColdwellMajorJames.jpg"
face-image: img/portraits/ColdwellMajorJames.jpg

Coldwell will lead us to victory!


@GHW

= The Williams Faction

<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: row; text-align: left; ">
    George Williams is a former president of the UFC(SS) and on the left-wing of the party. 
    Williams led the UFC(SS) into provincial politics on a socialist programme and was the architect behind the controversial "use-lease" policy, a program that would: 

    A: Disallow the sale of crown lands in favour of a use-lease

    B: Provide an option for farmers to 
